# Derived artifacts of the conference_assets design system.
# Both entries are outputs, not sources — the sources beside them are versioned.

# Self-contained copies built by library/sync.py: tokens.css and components.css
# inlined into each template so a published Claude Design component has no
# external <link> to 404 on. Fully regenerable:
#     python3 library/sync.py            rebuild
#     python3 library/sync.py --check    exit 1 if stale
# Never edit dist/ directly — edit the source template and rebuild.
library/dist/

# Byte-exact snapshot of the online Claude Design project, written by
#     python3 studio/_pull.py --out _pristine
# It is a diffing baseline, not a source. Note the caveat: _pull.py reads the
# Claude Code session transcript, so this is only regenerable while that
# transcript survives. The durable record of what was imported is the commit
# that imported it, plus the online project itself.
studio/_pristine/

# library/out/ (rendered PDFs and rasterised proofs) is already covered by the
# repo-root `out` pattern.
